         "note": "two readers disagreed on the fourth figure, one giving 26323 and 26 March 1923, the other 26303, which would be 1903 and so outside the corpus. Read again at native resolution the fourth figure is a 2, identical in form to the first figure of the line, and nothing like the closed loop of the 6 beside it. 26 March 1923."
